    "5affa87f-87ca-4780-b708-7db8ee3a3d0a/EventContent": {
      "en": "The bushes keep swaying. <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name /> holds <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=GenderPossessive/> breath and focuses, observing every movement in the shrubbery...<NL>Suddenly, a dark shadow swiftly flashes past <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name />'s eyes—<NL>It's a <Character key=RoleBeast str=Name />!",
